! Synthetic FullProf resolution file (invented numbers) for scripts/tof-profile
!  Type of profile function: back-to-back exponentials * pseudo-Voigt
NPROF 9
!       Tof-min(us)    step      Tof-max(us)
TOFRG    800 5.0 14000
!       Zerot    Dtt1t       Dtt2t
ZD2TOT   -8.1 1615.0 -1.4
!     TOF-TWOTH of the bank
TWOTH    18.0
!       Sig-2     Sig-1     Sig-0
SIGMA    41.0 270.0 -30.0
!       Gam-2     Gam-1     Gam-0
GAMMA    0.8 0.0 0.0
!          alph0       beta0       alph1       beta1
ALFBE    1.05 0.079 2.1 0.0068
END
